        "description": "OperatorConfig is the top-level operator configuration.\n\n Lifecycle:\n   1. operator init ca                   — generate root CA → crypto.yaml\n   2. operator init cluster --ca \u003cpath\u003e  — generate cluster PKI + write operator.yaml\n   3. operator                           — run (IN_CLUSTER) or generate charts (GENERATE_ONLY)\n\n When deployed to Kubernetes:\n   operator.yaml  → ConfigMap  (cavalier-operator-config)\n   crypto.yaml    → Secret     (cavalier-operator-crypto)\n Both are mounted and merged by the operator at startup.",
