types.description:
IdentitySpiffeResource declares that a string field holds a resource SPIFFE ID
 that tacplus must be able to CONSTRUCT from sibling fields (SPIFFE plan D5),
 via resource_spiffe_id(trust_domain, <namespace_field>, kind, <id_field>).
 Generation FAILS when the referenced sibling fields are absent, so a resource
 owner identity can never be hand-formatted or left underspecified.

   string owner_spiffe = 2 [(spec.identity_spiffe_resource) = {
     namespace_field: "tenant_namespace";
     kind: "gitlab-event";
     id_field: "event_id";
   }];

