types.description:
OpaEvalAnnotation marks a message as an OPA policy evaluation input.
 tacplus generates a typed RPC on the opa service for each annotated message.
 The input message defines the evaluation parameters; the result message defines
 the typed output. Both must be in the same proto file.
 Example:
   message EntitlementEvalInput {
     option (spec.opa_eval) = {
       entry_point: "data.entitlements.profiles"
       result: "EntitlementEvalResult"
     };
     string email = 1;
     repeated string claims = 2;
   }

