          "defaulted": true,
          "unit": "bytes",
          "source": "default_bound"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "authorized_projects",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "authorized_projects are the project leaf names within the tenant that this\n caller may obtain an access token for (e.g. [\"prod\", \"staging\"]). The\n minted AT is always scoped to exactly one of these; a project switch\n re-mints against this list without requiring re-login. Leaf segments,\n relative to `namespace`.",
